cription": "Welcome to MASS, the Mega Asteroid Suppression Service, Agent. Your job is to protect this space station with your lightning sabers against Asteroids and Aliens. Are you ready?\n\nTest Your Skills!\n\n- 10 missions with increasing difficulty, can you complete them all?\n\n- 1V1 mode against an elite alien drone.\n\n- Use the local leader-board to compete with friends and family.\n\nEarn Goudas And Unlock Items!\n\n- Unlock cosmetic upgrades for your sabers.\n\n- Discover new alien landscapes and add them to your collection.\n\n- Uncover a secret weapon befitting an elite MASS agent.\n\nImmersive VR Environments!\n\n- 3d sound to help you pinpoint the location of enemies.\n\n- Unique alien landscapes with custom music.\n\nand More!\n\n- Play in endless mode, adjust the angle and speed to fit your skill level.\n\n- Fight your way to the top of the global leader-board.\n\n- Animated credits scene featuring a dance battle between the Attackians and MASS.\n\n- Access the Alien Dex to examine the Attackians up close.\n\nGood Luck, Agent.", "short_description": "Test your skills in this immersive VR space opera by Star 1 Studio. Utilize lightning sabers to strike down hordes of bionic extraterrestrials. Fight your way to the heart of the planet to defeat Attackian Leader RahKah. Unlock 10 missions, 10 alien landscapes, 8 saber colors, and a secret weapon."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.star1studio.com/home/asteroids-and-aliens-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Star1Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.star1studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "